      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<marimo-accordion data-labels='[&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003ch4 id=&#92;&quot;parametros-de-filtrado-comunes-para-el-pca-y-el-gwas&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cstrong&#92;u003ePar\u00e1metros de filtrado&#92;u003c/strong&#92;u003e (comunes para el PCA y el GWAS):&#92;u003c/h4&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;]' data-multiple='false'><div><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Filtrado de individuos/muestras</strong></span></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='emfo-0' random-id='9be804bd-a771-2170-6cfa-44eb9f37ef5d'><marimo-slider data-initial-value='0.05' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eM\u00e1ximo % de genotipos faltantes permitido por individuo&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-start='0' data-stop='0.2' data-step='0.01' data-steps='[]' data-debounce='false' data-disabled='false' data-orientation='&quot;horizontal&quot;' data-show-value='false' data-include-input='true' data-full-width='false'></marimo-slider></marimo-ui-element><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><span style=\"font-size:0.75em;\">\n<b>Nota</b>: Adem\u00e1s de este filtro, se eliminan tambi\u00e9n todos los individuos/muestras cuyo valor del <b>fenotipo</b> sea desconocido (NaN).\n</span></span></span></div><div style='height:20px'></div><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Filtrado de SNPs</strong></span></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='emfo-1' random-id='84d1d87a-35d7-9ae3-5765-56859cd14232'><marimo-slider data-initial-value='0.05' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eM\u00e1ximo % de genotipos faltantes permitido por SNP&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-start='0' data-stop='0.2' data-step='0.01' data-steps='[]' data-debounce='false' data-disabled='false' data-orientation='&quot;horizontal&quot;' data-show-value='false' data-include-input='true' data-full-width='false'></marimo-slider></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='emfo-2' random-id='153943e9-4cf1-639f-4994-6ddec3d80b80'><marimo-slider data-initial-value='0.95' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eM\u00e1xima frecuencia permitida para el alelo mayoritario&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-start='0.8' data-stop='0.95' data-step='0.01' data-steps='[]' data-debounce='false' data-disabled='false' data-orientation='&quot;horizontal&quot;' data-show-value='false' data-include-input='true' data-full-width='false'></marimo-slider></marimo-ui-element><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><span style=\"font-size:0.75em;\">\n<b>Nota</b>: Adem\u00e1s de estos filtros, <b>en el caso del PCA se incluye un cribado de SNPs por desequilibrio de ligamiento (LD)</b>.\nEsto se hace para evitar que regiones con LD elevado ejerzan una influencia desproporcionada sobre los componentes principales.\n<b>Este cribado no se aplica en el filtrado para GWAS</b>, ya que se busca maximizar la cobertura gen\u00f3mica para encontrar asociaciones.\n</span></span></span></div></div></div></marimo-accordion>"
